"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>8315368</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1059632A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAKO YOICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONY CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKO, YOICHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAKO YOICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKO, YOICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Pits formed according to a first set of data to be recorded and constituting a track together with lands between the pits are deformed according to a second set of data so as to effect recording.  The first and second sets of data are combinedly reproduced, thereby realizing audio reproduction of wide frequency band.  The first set of data can be reproduced by a conventional disk reproducing device.  The reproduction of the first set of data is controlled by using the second set of data so as to protect the recorded data.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Selon cette invention, on déforme les creux, qui sont formés sur la base d'un premier ensemble de données à enregistrer et qui constituent une piste conjointement avec les espaces vierges séparant lesdits creux, sur la base d'un deuxième ensemble de données, et ce de manière à effectuer un enregistrement. On reproduit de façon combinée les premier et deuxième ensembles de données de manière à effectuer la reproduction sonore à bande de fréquence large. Le premier ensemble de données peut être reproduit au moyen d'un dispositif de lecture de disque traditionnel. La reproduction du premier ensemble de données est commandée à l'aide du deuxième ensemble de données, ce qui permet de protéger les données enregistrées.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>